'''Li'l Island Cat''' (ちびネコ島 ''Chibi Neko Shima'', '''Chibi Island Cat''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy first found in [[Tiny Fins (Deadly)|Li'l Fish Awakens!]] He was added in [[Version 5.10 Update|Version 5.10]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Li'l Island Cat
|image = E 328.png
|appearance = [[Tiny Fins (Deadly)|Li'l Fish Awakens!]]
[[Path to +45|Li'l Cat's Trial]]
|money drop = 320¢ - 1,264¢
}}

==Enemy==
It has a lot of health (higher than [[Manic Island Cat (Enemy)|Manic Island Cat]]) and a non-stop Area Attack, so this unit can be hard to fight when many of them are stacked. It surprisingly has a slower attack rate than [[Crazed Fish Cat (Enemy)|Crazed Fish Cat]] and Manic Island Cat, but still has the same range as both of them.

